/*  EXPECTED: COMPILES and runs; compiled output must match the interpreter.

    Written to attack the copy of a text stored where a body cannot see how long the target
    lives (2026-11-17 review): text for each out of a rabbit (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O4). */

Define outer as a series of text.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define inner as a series of text.
    Insert ("in" joined to "ner") into inner.
    For each word in inner, repeat:
        Insert word into outer.
    Done.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State outer.
